    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You receive a letter from your uncle begging you to return to the house where you were born. When you arrive, no one comes to greet you, and the house is empty. It's up to you to investigate what's happening. Find the answers as you solve various puzzles. Will you be able to uncover what happened?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Apus\u00a0</strong>is an escape room with a mystery setting that will test your logical skills. Crack secret codes and solve puzzles as you explore different scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover what happened to your uncle and solve the mystery behind it.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that challenge your logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple rooms while searching for clues and hidden objects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You receive a letter from your uncle begging you to return to the house where you were born. When you arrive, no one comes to greet you, and the house is empty. It's up to you to investigate what's happening. Find the answers as you solve various puzzles. Will you be able to uncover what happened?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Apus\u00a0</strong>is an escape room with a mystery setting that will test your logical skills. Crack secret codes and solve puzzles as you explore different scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover what happened to your uncle and solve the mystery behind it.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles that challenge your logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple rooms while searching for clues and hidden objects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "You return to the house where you were born, but the place is empty, and the silence is unsettling. Only you can uncover what happened. Explore isometric environments, solve challenging puzzles, and use escape room and point-and-click mechanics to unravel the mystery and discover the truth",
